-- CP-84b: the classroom and craft words the CP-84 draft left out. In the school's usage a thing a class handles or a natural or craft material is
-- "Teaching & activity materials (TLM)" and a sticker is stationery. `materials.category_words` is a seed_once setting, so a seed change reaches a
-- database that already has it by this migration, and only where the value is still the CP-84 draft: a school that has taught a word of its own
-- (Catalogue, "Teach a word") keeps what it has. A database made from this repository starts with the new value from the seed and is not touched here.
